    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Astral Sanctum</strong> is a retro-inspired puzzle platformer where every room is a test of magic, timing, and creative problem-solving. Play as a young wizard navigating a labyrinth of ancient chambers, each packed with traps, monsters, and secrets waiting to be uncovered.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Harness your magic to create or destroy blocks, fend off enemies, and unlock paths forward. But plan your moves carefully, resources are limited, and every level is a puzzle you\u2019ll need to crack to advance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3781270/extras/8e908cd9ba1e68418eca3e6afabc13cb.avif?t=1751286172\" width=459 height=101 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Puzzle-driven platforming</strong><br>Each room is a handcrafted challenge requiring clever thinking, precise movement, and careful use of magic.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Master magical abilities</strong><br>Conjure blocks, break walls, burn foes, and manipulate your surroundings with a versatile set of spells.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3781270/extras/490f5c96922b6609968f03a8e240ca34.avif?t=1751286172\" width=459 height=101 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenging enemies and hazards</strong><br>Face off against enemies, traps, and shifting environments that test your reflexes and strategy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Secrets and collectibles</strong><br>Explore hidden paths, uncover bonus challenges, and power up your character with rare items.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Astral Sanctum</strong> is a retro-inspired puzzle platformer where every room is a test of magic, timing, and creative problem-solving. Play as a young wizard navigating a labyrinth of ancient chambers, each packed with traps, monsters, and secrets waiting to be uncovered.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Harness your magic to create or destroy blocks, fend off enemies, and unlock paths forward. But plan your moves carefully, resources are limited, and every level is a puzzle you\u2019ll need to crack to advance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3781270/extras/8e908cd9ba1e68418eca3e6afabc13cb.avif?t=1751286172\" width=459 height=101 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Puzzle-driven platforming</strong><br>Each room is a handcrafted challenge requiring clever thinking, precise movement, and careful use of magic.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Master magical abilities</strong><br>Conjure blocks, break walls, burn foes, and manipulate your surroundings with a versatile set of spells.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3781270/extras/490f5c96922b6609968f03a8e240ca34.avif?t=1751286172\" width=459 height=101 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenging enemies and hazards</strong><br>Face off against enemies, traps, and shifting environments that test your reflexes and strategy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Secrets and collectibles</strong><br>Explore hidden paths, uncover bonus challenges, and power up your character with rare items.</p></li></ul>",
